                    <button id="btn-submit-adjustment" onclick="window.submitBalanceAdjustment()" class="flex-[1.2] bg-blue-600 text-white py-3.5 rounded-xl font-bold shadow-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition">אשר ועדכן יתרה</button>
